sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Old owner
  participant P1 as Migration
  participant P2 as New owner
  participant P3 as Route edge
  alt Required current prerequisites hold
    P0->>P1: 1 Freeze scope and retain baseline hashes
    P1->>P2: 2 Deploy read-only and compare responses
    P1->>P0: 3 Stop new writes and fence old workers
    P0->>P2: 4 Snapshot and replay to accepted watermark
    P1->>P2: 5 Reconcile rows digests artifacts and events
    P1->>P3: 6 Switch one route ownership epoch
    P3->>P2: 7 Allow only new owner writes
    P1->>P2: 8 Verify UI and repair or finalize cutover
  else A prerequisite fails or an external outcome is uncertain
    Note over P0,P3: After accepted new writes, rollback needs reconciled reverse migration or forward repair. Routing alone cannot restore lost facts.
  end
